Error [E0320]: struct construction uses `ImportErr{…}`, not `ImportErr.{…}`
  --> tests/ui/carrier_partial_not_kept.jet:8:48
    |
  8 |     if rows.len() == 0 -> return Err(ImportErr.{broken: 1})
    |                                                ^
 Why: literal heads place no dot before their brace (D-LIT-DOT1)
 Fix: write `ImportErr{…}`

Error [E0320]: typed collection construction uses `[T]{…}`, not `[T].{…}`
  --> tests/ui/carrier_partial_not_kept.jet:13:35
    |
 13 |     spotty :: import_rows([String].{})
    |                                   ^
 Why: D-LIT-DOT1 drops the constructor dot from every literal head
